			<p>For in-person supply donations, we will accept sealed foods, bottled waters/drinks, relatively clean clothes, rain coats, umbrellas, socks, shoes, packaged toiletries (e.g. deodorants, tampons, toothbrushes, toothpaste, shampoos, etc.), and blankets. If you wish to donate an item that doesn't fall into one of these categories, feel free to ask us over our Instagram or in person and we'll let you know if we can accept it!</p>
